  "scope": "Explicit source DLOAD/DMP, PDDL, BDSU, DDV, STORE, SL1, STODL and RVQ phases compute all three DCDU increments from DTHETASM and half-amplitude CDU sine/cosine pairs. The 18 native phase returns preserve source scratch, registers, MODE, stack pushes/pops, stores and controls. Every returned DANZIG with EDOP0 is a genuine Executive check; pending second operations retain canonical ownership. Producer exclusion spans each original operation, and no numerical return itself invents a scheduler yield. Final RVQ accepts all ordinary fixed FCADR banks and derives INTBIT15/A from the saved return. The new domain extension requalifies lower fixed-bank returns without changing the frozen permanent-interface packet."
